{
    "title": "Color Phone Call Screen App",
    "description": "Color Phone Call Screen App: Refresh your calls with diverse call screen themes.\r\n\r\nBored with the monotony on your phone every time you receive a call?\r\nYou seek a splash of uniqueness for an incoming call screen?\r\n\r\n\u2705 Right now, Color Phone Call Screen App will do it for you. It is a personalization tool that helps your style and mood with different call themes. Certainly, Color Phone App is specially designed to bring you color themes with:\r\n\r\n<b>KEY FEATURES:</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Change incoming call screens with a diverse color phone call screen theme.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Change the phone call theme for each person in your contacts.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Easily customize call theme to your style.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Create your own incoming call screen.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Change the call screen quickly with just 1 click.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Customize your calling dialer with various call themes, icons, avatars, backgrounds, and ringtones.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Preview color phone call themes.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Update new color phone call screen themes, call buttons every weekend.\r\n\r\n<b>DIVERSE CALL THEME:</b>\r\nColor Phone Call Screen App offers a plethora of artistic call screen themes: anime, car, cat, flower, halloween, K-Pop, korea, marvel, nature, noel, neon, ramadan, vintage, etc.which helps you create your special call phone screen when you have an incoming call. Instantly personalize your call screen for both incoming and outgoing calls button.\r\n\r\n<b>CUSTOM RINGTONES:</b>\r\nAnother way to personalize your phone dialer is to custom ringtone for different contacts or groups. You can also adjust the vibration settings for ringtone songs with the color phone app.\r\n\r\n<b>DIY CALL SCREEN:</b>\r\nColor Phone Call app customize call wallpaper or avatars by choosing from a variety of wallpapers in this app's collection or your photo library and combined with unique avatars. Change your call acceptance and rejection icons for a distinctive touch. Let's craft your individualized caller screen theme!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude4c Since then, the Color Phone Call Screen App has created thousands of artistic call screens.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Each incoming call becomes a moment of delight, showcasing your personalized phone themes with dynamic color phone call theme and ringtone sounds.\r\n\r\n<b>IMPORTANT NOTE</b>\r\nThe <b>FOREGROUND_SERVICE</b> and <b>FOREGROUND_SERVICE_PHONE_CALL</b> permission ensures the appropriate use of user-facing foreground services.\r\nFor apps targeting Android 14 and above, you must specify a valid foreground service type for each foreground service used in my app.\r\n\r\nTry screen theme color for calling apps now to enjoy a new call screener experience! It's time to get a striking phone screen, DOWNLOAD AND ENJOY IT NOW.What are you waiting for? Hurry up and download.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Color Phone Call Screen App: Refresh your calls with diverse call screen themes.<br><br>Bored with the monotony on your phone every time you receive a call?<br>You seek a splash of uniqueness for an incoming call screen?<br><br>\u2705 Right now, Color Phone Call Screen App will do it for you. It is a personalization tool that helps your style and mood with different call themes. Certainly, Color Phone App is specially designed to bring you color themes with:<br><br><b>KEY FEATURES:</b><br>\ud83d\udd25 Change incoming call screens with a diverse color phone call screen theme.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Change the phone call theme for each person in your contacts.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Easily customize call theme to your style.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Create your own incoming call screen.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Change the call screen quickly with just 1 click.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Customize your calling dialer with various call themes, icons, avatars, backgrounds, and ringtones.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Preview color phone call themes.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Update new color phone call screen themes, call buttons every weekend.<br><br><b>DIVERSE CALL THEME:</b><br>Color Phone Call Screen App offers a plethora of artistic call screen themes: anime, car, cat, flower, halloween, K-Pop, korea, marvel, nature, noel, neon, ramadan, vintage, etc.which helps you create your special call phone screen when you have an incoming call. Instantly personalize your call screen for both incoming and outgoing calls button.<br><br><b>CUSTOM RINGTONES:</b><br>Another way to personalize your phone dialer is to custom ringtone for different contacts or groups. You can also adjust the vibration settings for ringtone songs with the color phone app.<br><br><b>DIY CALL SCREEN:</b><br>Color Phone Call app customize call wallpaper or avatars by choosing from a variety of wallpapers in this app&#39;s collection or your photo library and combined with unique avatars. Change your call acceptance and rejection icons for a distinctive touch. Let&#39;s craft your individualized caller screen theme!<br><br>\ud83d\ude4c Since then, the Color Phone Call Screen App has created thousands of artistic call screens.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Each incoming call becomes a moment of delight, showcasing your personalized phone themes with dynamic color phone call theme and ringtone sounds.<br><br><b>IMPORTANT NOTE</b><br>The <b>FOREGROUND_SERVICE</b> and <b>FOREGROUND_SERVICE_PHONE_CALL</b> permission ensures the appropriate use of user-facing foreground services.<br>For apps targeting Android 14 and above, you must specify a valid foreground service type for each foreground service used in my app.<br><br>Try screen theme color for calling apps now to enjoy a new call screener experience! It&#39;s time to get a striking phone screen, DOWNLOAD AND ENJOY IT NOW.What are you waiting for? Hurry up and download.",
